# REGRESSION (`todo/t0841`, R48 Track D1) — the FILTER arm present.
#
# A comprehension with an `if` filter runs its element expression on a SUBSET
# of the iterations, so the number of aliases and the number of frees differ
# from the source length. The cell exists because the filter is walked in the
# shared helper's `tail` slot (called in BOTH passes) rather than after the
# two-pass call: get that slot wrong and the filter's own uses lose their
# back-edge protection while the element expression keeps it.
#
# AXIS CELL: comprehension kind = LIST · body sub-position = ELEMENT ·
# filter = PRESENT · source = RANGE · element type = String (heap-forced).
#
# RED-VERIFIED at pre-fix HEAD, both lanes: run rc 134, `free(): double free
# detected in tcache 2` (C and `--backend=llvm`); `--sanitize` reports
# `AddressSanitizer: attempting double-free`.

String mk(String a, String b):
    return a + b

void main():
    String s = mk("a", "b")
    Vector[String] parts = [s for i in 0..5 if i % 2 == 0]
    print(parts.len())
    print("".join(parts))
